// D4 — LSASS dump written to disk
// Author:  Jenna Frank (Hot Pink Huntress)
// Hunt:    Hunt 22 "Harborlight" — Akira ransomware, Microsoft Sentinel
// ATT&CK:  T1003.001 (OS Credential Dumping: LSASS Memory)
// Source:  Sysmon EventID 11 (File Create)
// Status:  Proposed. Replay TP in the hunt window; benign control pending.
//
// EventID 11 for a .dmp path containing lsass or written by a process whose Image
// contains spoolsv. This is narrower than a general non-diagnostic dump rule.

HarborlightDental_CL
| where EventTime > ago(1d) and EventID == 11
| where TargetFilename has ".dmp" and (TargetFilename has "lsass" or Image has "spoolsv")
| project EventTime, host, User, Image, TargetFilename

// FP/tuning: FP rate unmeasured; legitimate diagnostic dumps may match. WER paths
// and werfault are not excluded by this body.
